VALUES (NULL, NULL, 5629, 'Dungeons & Dragons Online', 'Dungeons & Dragons Online', 'game', 2006, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2q0k.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/arhfk.jpg', 'Centered in the city of Stormreach, DDO is set on the fictional continent of Xen''drik, in the world of Eberron, a Dungeons and Dragons campaign setting. Xen''drik is a vastly unexplored and wild locale, once the center of the Advanced Giant Civilization, which was destroyed thousands of years before. Players can create their characters following the revised edition of D&D 3.5 rule-set fashion, and play them in both indoor and outdoor environments, including dungeons.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/dungeons-and-dragons-online', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Mac"]', NULL, 7.7, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
