VALUES (NULL, NULL, 504, 'Fable III', 'Fable III', 'game', 2010, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co231s.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6rb.jpg', 'Set 50 years after the events of Fable II, the continent of Albion (where the Fable series is set) is under the control of Logan, a tyrant king and the Hero''s older brother[1]. The player''s character, the "Hero", is forced into a quest to become a revolutionary leader to defeat Logan after he reveals his true personality to the Hero. Over the course of the first half of the game, the Hero will overthrow Logan and become ruler of Albion themselves. During the second half of the game, a strange force from Aurora, called The Darkness will threaten Albion and the player has to decide how to react to it.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/fable-iii', '["PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox 360"]', NULL, 7.3, 0, 9.01, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
