VALUES (NULL, NULL, 22281, 'Jet Li: Rise to Honor', 'Jet Li: Rise to Honor', 'game', 2004, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4pwf.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/vwymsvqvadks81zdliyo.jpg', 'Kit Yun (character model after Jet Li), soon finds himself in non-stop action, due to following a dying man''s wish.

Cinematic storytelling with martial arts we could only see in Jet Li''s movies, now as a game, leads through a dozen levels spanning Hong Kong and San Francisco while you fight out of duty, or for honor.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/jet-li-rise-to-honor', '["PlayStation 2"]', NULL, 6.2, 0, 9.02, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
