Hawken is a multiplayer first person shooter that places you inside a mechanized war machine on the battlefield of a dystopian world. With tactical, fast-paced gameplay in customizable and upgradable mechs across multiple competitive modes, Hawken is explosively fun.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/hawken', '["PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 5.7, 0, 1.04, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
