VALUES (NULL, NULL, 44703, 'Silent Line: Armored Core', 'Silent Line: Armored Core', 'game', 2003, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p0e.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sc7ig6.jpg', 'Explorers have uncovered a previously unknown megacity that is well protected from scouting incursions. When all attempts at penetrating the border are met with destruction, the call goes out to the Ravens, a team of mercenaries hired by the government. As a Raven, you must pilot armored mech suits and destroy enemy weapon systems. A new first-person view allows you to experience a mission from the cockpit. Silent Line: Armored Core also lets you go head-to-head with up to four players or team up for fierce two-on-two battles.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/silent-line-armored-core', '["PlayStation Portable", "PlayStation 2"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
