VALUES (NULL, NULL, 13621, 'Manifold Garden', 'Manifold Garden', 'game', 2019, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2ws9.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ardcu.jpg', 'Manifold Garden is a game that reimagines physics and space.

Explore a world of beautiful Escher-esque architecture where the laws of physics are different. Geometry repeats infinitely in every direction and falling down leads you back to where you started. Manipulate gravity to change your perspective and see the world in new ways. Master the rules of the universe and restore a barren world with vegetation and life.

Key Features
- An expansive and visually striking world filled with mind-bending puzzles.
- Manipulate gravity to gain new perspectives and walk on any visible surface.
- Experience space in new ways as you explore infinitely repeating Escher-esque architecture.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/manifold-garden', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, 8.3, 0, 1.09, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
