VALUES (NULL, NULL, 6614, 'Zero Escape: Virtue''s Last Reward', 'Zero Escape: Virtue''s Last Reward', 'game', 2012, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co260l.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar5wn.jpg', 'The second game in the Zero Escape series.
Zero Escape: Virtue''s Last Reward is a mystery/thriller visual novel. It is story focused with multiple endings that use player choices and puzzle rooms to progress.

Additions to the game include an ''auto-advance text'' mode, so players can listen to the voice acting without clicking through dialog, a memo function that allows players to note anything they feel is useful, and a flow chart that shows how alternate choices unfold. The in-game calculator has been removed.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/zero-escape-virtue-s-last-reward', '["PlayStation 4", "Nintendo 3DS", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation Vita", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 8.7, 0, 10.025, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
