VALUES (NULL, NULL, 10125, 'Toy Commander', 'Toy Commander', 'game', 1999, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co450b.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sck9k1.jpg', 'In each mission, the player controls one or more toy vehicles to accomplish certain objectives. The objectives in each mission vary widely. In some missions, the player must drive an army truck and shoot things, in some it is necessary to fly helicopters to pick up and drop off objects, and in some the player races against computer-controlled vehicles.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/toy-commander', '["Dreamcast"]', NULL, 6.1, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
