VALUES (NULL, NULL, 37095, 'Moss', 'Moss', 'game', 2018, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1i1j.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/are2c.jpg', 'In Moss, players can reach out, touch, and interact with the environment while guiding Quill through her journey. As a character within the world, players will work together with Quill to solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and conquer any danger that comes their way,” said Danny Bulla, co-founder and design director of Polyarc. “As gamers, we’ve been conditioned for years to hold a gamepad in our laps when playing games, letting our thumbs and fingers do the controlling. It has been a great experience to create an immersive game that encourages players to reach into and interact with a tactile world.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/moss', '["Meta Quest 2", "PlayStation VR2", "Windows Mixed Reality", "PlayStation VR", "SteamVR", "Meta Quest 3", "Oculus Rift", "Oculus Quest"]', NULL, 8.1, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
