VALUES (NULL, NULL, 2703, 'Micro Machines', 'Micro Machines', 'game', 1991, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3b7a.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/a6oiltqjardzk9dbebng.jpg', 'Micro Machines is a classic racing game. Simple, fast-paced and lots of fun. You are given the control of miniature cars, choppers, speedboats, racecars, tanks, jeeps, formulas and many more vehicles to choose and about 20 different tracks to drive on. You''ll have to race AI opponents or your friends on various locations such as kitchen desks, pool tables, workshops, school desks, gardens, bathtubs etc.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/micro-machines', '["Nintendo Entertainment System"]', NULL, 6.9, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-26 23:52:17', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
