VALUES (NULL, NULL, 974, 'Resident Evil 4', 'Resident Evil 4', 'game', 2005, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2wk8.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6ftb.jpg', 'Resident Evil 4 is the sixth installment in the Resident Evil series and is often noted for its departure from the fixed camera angles of earlier titles. It introduced an over-the-shoulder third-person perspective, faster-paced gunplay, and more dynamic controls. The game features larger, more open environments and a new AI system that enables enemies to coordinate attacks and attempt to corner the player. Enemies exhibit more human-like behavior, such as climbing ladders, opening doors, and using weapons.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/resident-evil-4', '["Nintendo GameCube"]', NULL, 8.4, 0, 5.88, '2026-11-19 20:56:22', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
