Hitman World of Assassination brings together the best of Hitman, Hitman 2 and Hitman 3 including the main campaign, contracts mode, escalations, elusive target arcades and Hitman: Freelancer.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/hitman-world-of-assassination', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "Nintendo Switch 2", "PlayStation VR", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "SteamVR", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 9.0, 0, 6.05, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
