VALUES (NULL, NULL, 256960, 'Genshin Impact: A New Star Approaches', 'Genshin Impact: A New Star Approaches', 'game', 2020, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6ru6.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar2ht2.jpg', 'Version 1.1 of Genshin Impact, which included:
• New characters: Tartaglia, Zhongli, Diona and Xinyan
• New main story quests: Chapter 1, Act III - A New Star Approaches
• New story quests for Tartaglia and Zhongli
• New main event: Unreconciled Stars
• City Reputation System
• …and more!', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/genshin-impact-a-new-star-approaches', '["PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 5.535, '2026-11-21 21:29:28', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
