VALUES (NULL, NULL, 11492, 'Mafia III', 'Mafia III', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2mll.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar4k7.jpg', 'Mafia III is an open-world action-adventure game played from a third-person perspective and the third entry in the Mafia series. Players control Lincoln Clay across a large recreation of the fictional city of New Bordeaux, modeled on New Orleans, tackling missions with a mix of gunplay, melee combat, stealth, and a cover system. Objectives can be approached in different ways, and players seize territory from rival criminal outfits and hand districts to their lieutenants. Period cars can be driven across the city, and the setting and licensed soundtrack draw heavily on the late 1960s American South.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/mafia-iii', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "PlayStation 5", "Mac", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 6.7, 0, 3.08666666666666644e+00, '2026-11-22 03:06:26', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
