VALUES (NULL, NULL, 12482, 'Layers of Fear', 'Layers of Fear', 'game', 2016, 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1nhw.jpg', 'https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ar6wf.jpg', 'Layers of Fear is a psychedelic horror that will keep you on-edge for the reminder of the game. Delve deep into the mind of an insane painter and discover the secret of his madness, as you walk through a constantly shifting house.

Heavily inspired by the masterpiece paintings from the past centuries, and the architecture and décor from the XIX century. Layers of Fear is a truly unique experience, where each move of the camera can change your surroundings.

Layer by layer uncover the visions, fears and horrors that entwine the protagonist and finish the masterpiece he has strived so long to create.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/layers-of-fear', '["PlayStation 4", "Linux", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "Mac", "Xbox One"]', NULL, 7.4, 0, 6.255, '2026-11-24 04:24:23', '2026-11-26 23:52:17')
